Due to the fact I have no code in place for any cutscenes, I'll convey whatever Papyrus says.
I'm positive that you know those tiles, those that I'm blocking out of your sight right now.
Pink tiles have no effect and can be walked on freely.
Green tiles force you to fight a monster, someday.
Red tiles act as solid walls.
Yellow tiles force you to go back to the last tile you stepped on.
Orange tiles change your flavor to orange.
Purple tiles force you to continue moving in the same direction. Also, they change your flavor to lemon.
Blue tiles vary in function depending on several factors. If the blue tile is adjacent to a yellow tile, the blue tile acts identically to a yellow tile. The same happens if your flavor is orange. Otherwise, the blue tile acts identically to a pink tile.
If you need a quick rerun, come back to Papyrus.
